# The prod environment's own inputs to scripts/gcp/deploy.sh (dev.env says how these files are
# read). Deliberately empty: every input takes the Terraform default, so no refusal reason is
# logged, no synthetic content or gate-bypassing source is accepted, and a deploy without a real
# alert recipient is refused. Never set REQUIRE_ALERT_RECIPIENT here: it is dev's alone.
#
# No EXPECTED_PROJECT_ID yet: the production project is not designated, so deploy.sh refuses to
# deploy prod anywhere. Name it here, in a reviewed pull request, when it is.
#
# NAME=value lines only (test/ci/environment-inputs.test.ts).
